YHorizon-JM is dual-licensed.

Open-source license
  firmware/, host-rs/, sdk/, and tools/
    GNU General Public License v3.0 only (GPL-3.0-only)
    Full text: LICENSES/GPL-3.0.txt
    https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html

  mechanical/, hardware/, images/, and project documentation
  that is not part of the software directories above
    CERN Open Hardware Licence Version 2 - Strongly Reciprocal
    (CERN-OHL-S-2.0)
    Full text: LICENSES/CERN-OHL-S-2.0.txt
    https://cern.ch/cern-ohl

  Both open-source licenses allow commercial use. They also require
  reciprocation: software derivatives distributed under GPLv3 must
  ship complete corresponding source under GPLv3, and hardware
  designs and products conveyed under CERN-OHL-S must make the
  required design materials available under CERN-OHL-S.

Commercial license
  A separate commercial license is available from the copyright holder
  for use that does not follow the open-source obligations above,
  including closed-source integration, manufacture, and sale.
  Contact WeChat Yet_Latitude. The template is COMMERCIAL-LICENSE.md.
  That template grants nothing until the copyright holder agrees to it
  in writing. It does not add restrictions to GPLv3 or CERN-OHL-S.

Third-party files keep their own licenses when those licenses are
stated in the file or its directory.

